OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran who was homeless sets up
OL,4,Asupport group
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former military veteran from
OL,7,FBridgwater who spent time in homeless
OL,8,Faccommodation has set up an online
OL,9,Fsupport group for other ex-soldiers
OL,10,Fafter he managed to turn his own life
OL,11,Faround.
OL,13,FChris Brandes, who was in the Royal
OL,14,FLogistics Corp, was made homeless in
OL,15,F2023 following the breakdown of a
OL,16,Frelationship and he ended up staying in
OL,17,Fsheltered accommodation in Taunton.
OL,19,FWhile there he became sober, had
OL,20,Ftherapy and began volunteering. He said
OL,21,Fhe then began to take on evening
OL,22,Fclasses to "better" himself.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
