OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran who was homeless sets up
OL,4,Asupport group
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has since set up an online support
OL,7,Fgroup for the veteran community, known
OL,8,Fas UKVeteran75/Support, which brings
OL,9,Fformer soldiers together.
